00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:59.610
The drugs that did work on cells
that were already infected,

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:02.293
or on cells before they
were infected by the virus.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.110
- Yeah so, in this paper

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.930
and in the figure that I've talked about.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:12.300
They treated the cells with
the drug prior to infection.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:15.960
So kinda like, prophylactically sort of.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.770
And so they also in this
paper, we didn't talk about it,

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:23.110
they looked and they saw that
the drug was pretty good at

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:27.570
preventing infection for up,
if you gave it up to four hours

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:30.800
after you infected the cells.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:34.210
